                                                  &lt;html&gt;
                                                       Enable Maps Ethernet driver to multiple EcuC partitions to make the modules API
                                                       available in this partition. The Eth driver will operate as an independent instance in each of the partitions.
                                                  &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ORIGIN>CCFC</ORIGIN>
